{"seq":1,"slug":"lime-surrogate","title":"LIME 与局部代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/lime-surrogate","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"lime-与局部代理\">LIME 与局部代理</h1><p>2016 年 LIME 论文里有一张著名的图：一个区分「狼」和「哈士奇」的分类器准确率很高，但 LIME 把它的局部解释画出来后，高亮的区域全是<strong>雪地背景</strong>而非动物本身。原来训练集里狼的照片大多有雪，模型学会了「有雪就是狼」。这张图让 LIME 一夜成名，因为它用一种朴素到近乎廉价的方式，揭穿了一个看似强大的黑箱。这种「廉价而通用」正是 LIME 的精髓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LIME 的全部设计都挂在几个相互咬合的概念上，先厘清它们，后面的流程与陷阱才好理解。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>局部代理（local surrogate）</strong>：不去拟合整个模型的全局行为，只在目标样本附近拟合一个简单模型来代表黑箱的局部行为。</li>\n<li><strong>模型无关（model-agnostic）</strong>：只通过「喂输入、取输出」来查询黑箱，不依赖它的内部结构或梯度，因此能套在任意模型上。</li>\n<li><strong>可解释表示（interpretable representation）</strong>：把模型实际吃的高维输入（词向量、像素）映射到人类能懂的二值单元（词在/不在、超像素显示/遮挡），扰动与解释都在这个空间里进行。</li>\n<li><strong>邻域权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：给靠近目标样本的扰动样本更大权重，使代理聚焦在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 附近。</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega(g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：惩罚代理的非零系数个数，逼解释只用少数几个特征，避免难以阅读的长清单。</li>\n<li><strong>不稳定性</strong>：扰动是随机采样的，同一输入多次运行可能得到不同解释，这是 LIME 最受诟病的软肋。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心思想-局部线性逼近\">核心思想：局部线性逼近</h2><p>LIME 全称 Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations，三个关键词概括了它的全部设计：局部、可解释、模型无关。它的洞见是——一个全局上任意复杂的决策边界，在某一个样本的足够小的邻域里，几乎总能用一条直线（线性模型）近似。于是解释单次预测，就退化成「在这一点附近拟合一个简单模型」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[选定要解释的样本 x] --&gt; B[在 x 邻域随机扰动生成样本]&#10;  B --&gt; C[用黑箱给每个扰动样本打标签]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按到 x 的距离给样本加权]&#10;  D --&gt; E[拟合稀疏线性代理模型 g]&#10;  E --&gt; F[代理的系数即为局部特征重要度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[选定要解释的样本 x] --&gt; B[在 x 邻域随机扰动生成样本]\n  B --&gt; C[用黑箱给每个扰动样本打标签]\n  C --&gt; D[按到 x 的距离给样本加权]\n  D --&gt; E[拟合稀疏线性代理模型 g]\n  E --&gt; F[代理的系数即为局部特征重要度]</pre><p>这套流程完全把黑箱当成一个只能查询输入输出的预言机，不需要梯度、不需要知道结构——这就是「模型无关」，使它能同时套在树模型、神经网络甚至外部 API 上。代价是它只解释这一个样本（局部），换别的样本要重新跑一遍。它与 <a href=\"../foundations/why-interpretability\">可解释性的动机与分类</a> 坐标系里「局部 + 模型无关 + 事后」的格子精确对应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数学形式与可解释表示\">数学形式与可解释表示</h2><p>LIME 要解的优化问题写出来很简洁：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi(x) = \\arg\\min_{g \\in G} \\; \\mathcal{L}(f, g, \\pi_x) + \\Omega(g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6304em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是被解释的黑箱，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是来自可解释模型族 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>（通常是稀疏线性模型）的代理，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是以样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 为中心的邻域权重（距离越近权重越大），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 在该邻域内对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的逼近误差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega(g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的复杂度（如非零系数个数）以保证解释简洁。</p>\n<p>一个关键且常被忽视的设计是<strong>可解释表示</strong>：模型实际吃的输入（如 768 维词向量、像素张量）人看不懂，所以 LIME 在一个对人友好的二值空间上做扰动。对文本，是「某个词在/不在」；对图像，是「某个超像素块（superpixel）显示/被遮挡」；对表格，是「某特征是否落在某区间」。扰动就是在这个 0/1 向量上随机翻位，再映射回原始输入喂给黑箱。解释最终落在这些人能理解的单元上，而非原始维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种数据类型的落地\">三种数据类型的落地</h2><p>LIME 的扰动策略随数据类型而变，理解这点才能正确使用它。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>可解释单元</th>\n<th>扰动方式</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表格</td>\n<td>特征（离散化为区间）</td>\n<td>按训练分布采样/扰动各特征</td>\n<td>离散化方式显著影响结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>词或 token</td>\n<td>随机删除若干词</td>\n<td>词间相关性被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>超像素块</td>\n<td>随机遮挡若干块为灰色</td>\n<td>超像素分割算法影响解释</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以图像为例：先用分割算法把图切成几十个超像素块，每个扰动样本随机遮挡其中一部分，把这些「残缺图」喂给黑箱拿到预测，再用「哪些块在场」作为特征拟合线性代理，系数为正且大的块就是支持该类别的证据——前面狼-雪地例子里，雪块的系数压倒了狼身上的块。</p>\n<p>文本上的扰动逻辑同理，但删除词会引出语言特有的麻烦：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 概念的极简伪代码：对一条文本预测做 LIME&#10;explain(x_text, f):&#10;    words = tokenize(x_text)&#10;    Z = []                       # 扰动样本集&#10;    for _ in range(n_samples):   # 例如 1000 次&#10;        mask  = random_binary_mask(len(words))&#10;        z_txt = render(words, mask)   # 按 mask 隐藏部分词&#10;        Z.append((mask, f(z_txt)))    # 记录 0/1 向量与黑箱预测&#10;    w = exp(-dist(mask, all_ones)**2 / kernel_width**2)  # π_x 邻域权重&#10;    return sparse_linear_fit(Z, w, k=top_k)              # 稀疏线性代理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 概念的极简伪代码：对一条文本预测做 LIME</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">explain(x_text, f):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    words </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenize(x_text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扰动样本集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_samples):   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 例如 1000 次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mask  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random_binary_mask(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(words))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z_txt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> render(words, mask)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按 mask 隐藏部分词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Z.append((mask, f(z_txt)))    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 记录 0/1 向量与黑箱预测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dist(mask, all_ones)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kernel_width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># π_x 邻域权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sparse_linear_fit(Z, w, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top_k)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 稀疏线性代理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份伪代码把三条设计线一次串起：<code>mask</code> 是<strong>可解释表示</strong>、<code>w</code> 是<strong>邻域权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>、<code>k=top_k</code> 是<strong>稀疏性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span></strong>。调大 <code>kernel_width</code> 邻域变宽、解释更趋全局但更糊，调小则更局部但更不稳——这个没有普适标准的超参数，正是后文不稳定性的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优势-陷阱与稳定性\">优势、陷阱与稳定性</h2><p>LIME 的优势是无可争议的：通用（任何黑箱）、直观（线性系数）、灵活（可换可解释表示）。但它有几个必须警惕的陷阱。</p>\n<p>最严重的是<strong>不稳定性</strong>。由于扰动是随机采样的，对同一个样本跑两次 LIME，得到的解释可能不一样；邻域宽度（核宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）这个超参数对结果影响巨大，却没有客观的设定标准。这直接关系到 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 里的稳健性维度——不稳定的解释难以信任。其次是<strong>局部线性假设的失效</strong>：若决策边界在该点附近高度弯曲，线性代理会逼近得很差，此时解释的忠实性堪忧，应当用删除/插入曲线去核验。第三是<strong>采样的分布外问题</strong>：随机翻位生成的样本可能在现实中根本不会出现（如一段缺了主语的句子），黑箱对它们的反应未必可靠。</p>\n<p>正因这些局限，社区发展出更有理论保证的归因方法。其中最重要的一条线索是：当把 LIME 的核宽与损失按特定方式选取时，它的解恰好等于 Shapley 值——这正是下一篇 <a href=\"shap-shapley\">SHAP 与 Shapley 值</a> 的出发点，SHAP 可视为给 LIME 补上了公理基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LIME 用「局部线性逼近」解释单次预测：扰动采样 + 加权拟合稀疏线性代理，系数即局部重要度。</li>\n<li>完全模型无关，靠可解释表示（词/超像素/区间）让解释落在人能懂的单元上。</li>\n<li>三种数据类型扰动策略不同，离散化与超像素分割等细节会显著左右结果。</li>\n<li>最大软肋是不稳定与核宽敏感，且局部线性假设可能失效，必须用忠实性度量核验。</li>\n<li>KernelSHAP 是 LIME 在特定加权下的特例，下一篇用 Shapley 公理为这类局部归因奠定唯一性基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LIME 与局部代理","id":"lime-与局部代理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心思想：局部线性逼近","id":"核心思想-局部线性逼近"},{"level":2,"text":"数学形式与可解释表示","id":"数学形式与可解释表示"},{"level":2,"text":"三种数据类型的落地","id":"三种数据类型的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"优势、陷阱与稳定性","id":"优势-陷阱与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"解释的评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/foundations/evaluating-explanations"},"next":{"title":"SHAP 与 Shapley 值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/shap-shapley"}}